{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49450","headline":"离别难 · 薛昭藴","name":"离别难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝马晓鞴雕鞍，罗帏乍别情难。\n那堪春景媚，送君千万里。\n半妆珠翠落，露华寒。\n红蜡烛，青丝曲，偏能钩引泪阑干。\n良夜促，香尘绿，魂欲迷，檀眉半歛愁低。\n未别心先咽，欲语情难说。\n出芳草，路东西，摇袖立。\n春风急，樱花杨柳雨凄凄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昭藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}